window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-149-14f985076721791a.json"]={sha256:"14f985076721791ac41273fc744cba5fc29c732263396cb0c7958dd1adc39115",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-e709364b759d8c0a","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.697/en","title":"ITU-T G.697: Optical monitoring for DWDM systems","titleEn":"ITU-T G.697: Optical monitoring for DWDM systems","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-149","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-149","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-150","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.697/en"],"title":"ITU 光纖量測：零錯誤 BER 的信賴界限","titleEn":"Optical link testing: confidence bound after zero bit errors","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 只有最差裕度非負才做有界通過宣告；變更組屬證據不足，不能直接判定光纖損壞。 uncertainty_corners.csv與保守/統計假設比較表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.6 與變更 -0.2 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Declare bounded acceptance only when worst-case margin is nonnegative; the changed case is inconclusive, not proof of damaged fiber. uncertainty_corners.csv and a conservative/statistical assumption comparison Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.6 and changed -0.2 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學BER界限要求不高於1e−8；1e9 bits足夠，1e8不夠；不得把信賴界限寫成認證。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching upper-bound target1e−8:1e9 bits suffice and1e8 do not; this confidence calculation is not certification.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可容許損耗10 dB，量測8.8 dB；發射與接收讀值界限各0.3 dB；變更界限各0.7 dB。 名義式 10-(8.8+0.3+0.3) = 0.6 dB；變更式 10-(8.8+0.7+0.7) = -0.2 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 枚舉兩個儀器誤差的四個角落；找出最大損耗，並保留校正日期與共同誤差來源。","合成測試零錯誤，觀測1e9 bits；第二組保持零錯誤但僅1e8 bits。 名義式 -log(0.05)/1e9 = 2.99573e-09 BER upper bound；變更式 -log(0.05)/1e8 = 2.99573e-08 BER upper bound。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 將界限乘N代回exp(−λ)=0.05；另檢查突發錯誤是否使獨立Poisson近似不成立。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic loss allowance10 dB and measured loss8.8 dB; transmitter/receiver error bounds each0.3 dB, changed to0.7 dB. Nominal 10-(8.8+0.3+0.3) = 0.6 dB; changed 10-(8.8+0.7+0.7) = -0.2 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate four corners of the two instrument-error intervals, locate maximum loss, and retain calibration dates and common errors.","Synthetic zero-error tests observe1e9 bits, then1e8 bits; only exposure changes. Nominal -log(0.05)/1e9 = 2.99573e-09 BER upper bound; changed -log(0.05)/1e8 = 2.99573e-08 BER upper bound. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Multiply the bound byN and verify exp(−λ)=0.05; check whether burst errors invalidate the independent Poisson approximation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-159","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.873.1/en"],"title":"G.873.1 線性保護：切換時間分解","titleEn":"G.873.1 linear protection: switching-time decomposition","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 只有最差裕度非負才做有界通過宣告；變更組屬證據不足，不能直接判定光纖損壞。 uncertainty_corners.csv與保守/統計假設比較表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.6 與變更 -0.2 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Declare bounded acceptance only when worst-case margin is nonnegative; the changed case is inconclusive, not proof of damaged fiber. uncertainty_corners.csv and a conservative/statistical assumption comparison Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.6 and changed -0.2 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學恢復上限50 ms；35通過、55不通過；此50 ms是本題門檻，不宣稱所有設備標準保證。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching recovery limit50 ms:35 passes and55 fails; this is the exercise budget, not a universal equipment guarantee.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可容許損耗10 dB，量測8.8 dB；發射與接收讀值界限各0.3 dB；變更界限各0.7 dB。 名義式 10-(8.8+0.3+0.3) = 0.6 dB；變更式 10-(8.8+0.7+0.7) = -0.2 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 枚舉兩個儀器誤差的四個角落；找出最大損耗，並保留校正日期與共同誤差來源。","合成偵測10 ms、確認5 ms、切換20 ms；變更偵測30 ms，其他固定。 名義式 10+5+20 = 35 ms；變更式 30+5+20 = 55 ms。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以最後正常與第一個恢復封包時間戳量中斷，再核對事件三段；給各記錄相同時基。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic loss allowance10 dB and measured loss8.8 dB; transmitter/receiver error bounds each0.3 dB, changed to0.7 dB. Nominal 10-(8.8+0.3+0.3) = 0.6 dB; changed 10-(8.8+0.7+0.7) = -0.2 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate four corners of the two instrument-error intervals, locate maximum loss, and retain calibration dates and common errors.","Synthetic detection10 ms, validation5 ms and switching20 ms; change detection to30 ms. Nominal 10+5+20 = 35 ms; changed 30+5+20 = 55 ms. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Measure the gap from last good to first recovered packet and reconcile three event intervals on a common timebase.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-e709364b759d8c0a","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.697/en","title":"ITU-T G.697: Optical monitoring for DWDM systems","titleEn":"ITU-T G.697: Optical monitoring for DWDM systems","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-6e1f064aaabebd71","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.873.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.873.1: Optical transport network linear protection","titleEn":"ITU-T G.873.1: Optical transport network linear protection","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
